  "notes": "The tallest family's tower: 6.5 m square and 33 m high, turquoise tile panels with terracotta bands, an open arched loggia of two arches a side under the roof, and stepped crenellations. Open 2 m wide door on local -Z; stairs climb ten floors, through the loggia, to a flat roof with a 1.25 m parapet. White limewash with cobalt trim since v2.",
